    <string name="max_files_help_title">Ukuthi lesi sikrini sinquma kanjani</string>
    <string name="max_files_help_body">Kunewindi elilodwa elinwetshiwe elinamathebhu amabili, futhi sonke isikrini singesaso: ayikho ibha yesihloko ngaphandle kwalo futhi alikho ifasitelana lesibili. Okufakiwe kuvela kuphasi eyodwa yezibalo enefomethi egxilile ehlukaniswe ngethebhu, ngakho-ke okukhiphayo kwe-ls akuncozululwa kudatha. Noma yini engalinganisiwe iboniswa njengengaziwa esikhundleni sokuthi ithi ziro, futhi umugqa wesimo usho ukuthi mangaki amafolda, mangaki amafayela nokuthi mangaki okufakiwe okufihliwe kwale folda, kanye nesikhala sohlelo lwayo lwefayela - okubikwe ngokuthi “akufundiwe” lapho kungenakulinganiswa. Amafayela afihliwe ahlala efihliwe ngokuzenzakalela futhi isibalo sawo sihlala kulowo mugqa ofanayo, ngakho ukucasha kuyamenyezelwa esikhundleni sokuthula. Ukucindezela okude kukhetha okufakiwe bese kuvula imiyalo yakho emunweni wakho: kopisha futhi usike gcwalisa ibhodi lokunamathisela, bese unamathisele bhala kufolda evuliwe phambi kwakho, ebuza ngokungqubuzana kwamagama ngaphambi kokuba kubhalwe noma yini. Konke ukusebenza kuyagadwa ngaphambi kokuthi kufinyelele kugobolondo: ifolda ayikwazi ukukopishelwa kuyona ngokwayo, ukunyakaza akukwazi ukukhomba umthombo wayo, futhi impande yesistimu yefayela ayikwazi ukususwa. Amakhophi, ukunyakaza, ukuminyanisa nokukhipha kusebenza njengemisebenzi yangemuva enephesenti elilinganiselwe - futhi lapho usayizi ungafundeki, umsebenzi uthi ukuqhubeka kwawo akwaziwa esikhundleni sokusungula eyodwa. Esikrinini esingu-600dp noma ngaphezulu amawindi amabili avela eceleni, ngalinye linendlela yalo nokubala kwalo.</string>
